# FreightQuote AI — Agentic Freight Operations Platform

> **Infosys Springboard Internship 7.0 · Batch 4 · Milestone 3 · Team-03**

FreightQuote AI is a multi-user, role-based web platform for freight forwarders. AI agents price spot quotes, rank carriers, watch weather and customs risk, and wait for a human to approve anything that matters. An AI Copilot answers questions about your own data in plain English (and in 35+ languages), and every answer is backed by an exact, visible SQL query.

## Highlights

- **Agent pipeline** — Route AI, Spot Quotes, Carriers, Weather Risk, Margin & Approvals, Customs and an anomaly watcher run on a background worker, raise tickets and wait for human approval.
- **Spot quote engine** — ML price (RandomForest) + 12% fuel + port fees + 15% operating cost, target margin around 20%. Quotes above $50,000 or below 10% margin need an approver.
- **Real sea routing** — ocean mask from the world coastline, real canals and straits (Suez, Panama, Malacca, Hormuz and more) and Dijkstra routing over a 1° water grid.
- **SQL-exact AI Copilot** — questions are turned into read-only, whitelisted SQL. The language model never invents a number.
- **Hybrid RAG** — BM25 + dense embeddings fused with Reciprocal Rank Fusion, then a cross-encoder reranker, with citations.
- **35+ languages** — questions and answers are translated on the GPU with Meta NLLB-200.
- **Simulators and Digital Twin** — seeded Monte Carlo what-if runs for every agent, stacked shocks, mitigation ranking, and scenarios sent to the approval queue. Live data is never changed.
- **Role-based access control** — each role sees only the pages it is allowed to, enforced in the UI and on the API.
- **Admin console** — runtime health, GPU and models, decisions, users and access, audit log, Teach Copilot, system check and data governance.
- **Data Feed Center** — upload, folder inbox or URL feeds are validated, auto-mapped, upserted into the live tables and the agents re-run.
- **Reports** — print-ready PDFs and CSV exports with KPI tiles, charts and a prioritised action list.
- **Audit trail** — every sensitive action is logged.

